          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Figure it out",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.226,
            0.881,
            0.262
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q1. Three guavas together weigh 1 kg. If they are roughly of the same size, each guava will roughly weigh ____kg.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.271,
            0.197,
            0.303
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{1}{3}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.31,
            0.882,
            0.346
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q2. A wholesale merchant packed 1 kg of rice in four packets of equal weight. The weight",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of each packet is kg."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.355,
            0.197,
            0.386
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 4 }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.394,
            0.882,
            0.431
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q3. Four friends ordered 3 glasses of sugarcane juice and shared it equally among themselves. Each one drank ____ glass of sugarcane juice",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.439,
            0.197,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 3 } { 4 }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.477,
            0.869,
            0.549
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q4. The big fish weighs",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "kg. The small one weighs",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "kg. Together they weigh ____ kg.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Ans. "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 3 } { 4 }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.556,
            0.881,
            0.593
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q5. Arrange these fraction words in order of size from the smallest to the biggest in the empty box below:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.601,
            0.854,
            0.62
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "One and a half, three quarters, one and a quarter, half, quarter, two and a half.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.627,
            0.355,
            0.661
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 4 } , \\frac { 1 } { 2 } , \\frac { 3 } { 4 } , 1 \\frac { 1 } { 4 } , 1 \\frac { 1 } { 2 } , 2 \\frac { 1 } { 2 }"
            }
          ]
        },
